Herdr Mods

tabs-dnd and pane-dnd are modified copies of the tabs and pane mods that ship
with the Herdr desktop app, version 0.1.16. Herdr is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Their icons (win-close.svg, win-max.svg, win-min.svg,
win-restore.svg, close.svg, split-right.svg, split-down.svg, zoom.svg,
unzoom.svg) are copies of the shipped icons.

The layout tab-drag/layouts/main-dnd.json is a modified copy of the main
layout that ships with Herdr 0.1.16.

Changes:
- tabs-dnd: drag a tab to reorder it with a drop line, drag a tab onto the
  pane area to split, and make the focused pane a tab when a grip drag ends on
  the tab bar. Icon paths point at mods/tabs-dnd/.
- pane-dnd: drag a pane by its header to the tab bar to make it a tab. Icon
  paths point at mods/pane-dnd/.
- main-dnd.json: the tab bar uses tabs-dnd and the pane headers use pane-dnd.
